orm-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">-</div><div data-canvas-width="118.202375" data-font-name="g_font_1250_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 188.221px; top: 985.038px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.917186, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr" class="">303.2 Annual</div><div data-canvas-width="103.38272500000001" data-font-name="g_font_1250_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 313.966px; top: 985.038px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.886771, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr" class="">inspections.</div><div data-canvas-width="688.9560250000002" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 424.75px; top: 985px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.866816, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr" class="">Except as otherwise provided in this article, each owner of a boiler, as defined in </div><div data-canvas-width="991.5263000000001" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 149.999px; top: 1009.01px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.874217, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr" class="">section 204 of the New York state labor law, excepting those boilers listed in subdivision five of such section of such </div><div data-canvas-width="422.2002499999999" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 149.999px; top: 1033.02px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.859004, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr" class="">labor law, shall have such boiler inspected at least</div><div data-canvas-width="538.0807000000001" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 584.504px; top: 1033.02px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.863866, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr" class="">once a year in accordance with this article. All individuals who </div><div data-canvas-