gy audits and to certify </div><div data-canvas-width="960.1315499999998" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 149.991px; top: 1280.26px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.853893, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">audit reports required by this article. Until such time as there is a national standard establishing qualifications for </div><div data-canvas-width="420.21032499999995" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 149.991px; top: 1304.27px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.840736, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">persons performing energy audits and such standa</div><div data-canvas-width="559.741625" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 571.237px; top: 1304.27px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.846704, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">rd has been adopted by the department, an energy auditor shall be </div><div data-canvas-width="963.7814750000006" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 149.991px; top: 1328.02px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.852307, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">a registered design professional with such other certification or qualification as the department deems to be appro-</div><div data-canvas-width="624.489925" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 149.991px; top: 1352.03px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.847436, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">priate. After the establishment of such a national standard, the department</div><div data-canvas-width="372.67415" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 765.498px; top: 1352.03px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.858037, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">may adopt the qua