 data-canvas-width="361.46085000000005" data-font-name="g_font_1250_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 188.176px; top: 321.515px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.912156, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">308.4 Energy efficiency report required. </div><div data-canvas-width="362.8926000000001" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 558.456px; top: 321.515px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.867559, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">Except as otherwise provided in section 28</div><div data-canvas-width="6.909750000000001" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 931.433px; top: 321.515px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(1.08035, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">-</div><div data-canvas-width="185.0568" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 938.434px; top: 321.515px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.883678, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">308.7, the owner of a </div><div data-canvas-width="968.7386499999996" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 149.934px; top: 345.522px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.859509, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">covered building shall file an energy efficiency report for such building between January first and December thirty</div><div data-canvas-width="6.909750000000001" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 1117.68px; top: 345.522px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(1.08035, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">-</div><div data-canvas-width="607.7425999999999" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 149.934px; top: 369.53px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.851851, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0p