m a person with authority to sign such statement on behalf of any utility company that </div><div data-canvas-width="909.3708250000001" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 224.945px; top: 1267.52px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.854103, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr" class="">would be responsible for the provision of gas service if such service were provided containing the following:</div><div data-canvas-width="31.562825000000004" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 224.945px; top: 1308.02px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.945703, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">1.1.</div><div data-canvas-width="187.6713" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 262.441px; top: 1308.02px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.851358, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">A certification that the</div><div data-canvas-width="659.2980500000002" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 459.69px; top: 1308.02px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.851875, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr" class="">building no longer receives gas service, including the last date upon which gas </div><div data-canvas-width="108.31085" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 262.441px; top: 1332.03px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.843159, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">was supplied</div><div data-canvas-width="175.68195" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 375.943px; top: 1332.03px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.84956, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">to such building; and</div><div data-canvas-width="31.562825000000004" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 224.945px; top: 1364.28px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.945703, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">1.2.</div><div data-canvas-width="14.981499999999999" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 262.441px; top: 1364.28px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(1.03025, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">A</div><div data-canvas-width="722.8262500000001" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 282.444px; top: 1364.28px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.848533, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">certification that the building was fully deactivated from service being provided by the</div><div data-canvas-width="119.04067500000002" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 1006.2px; top: 1364.28px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.874362, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">utility, includ-</div><div data-canvas-width="631.864475" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 262.461px; top: 1388.28px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.85071, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr" class="">ing the date upon which gas service was no longer provided to the building.</div><div data-canvas-width="15.8115" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 197.97px; top: 1418.54px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.947506, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">2.</div><div data-canvas-width="655.7332000000001" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 224.966px; top: 1418.54px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.8547, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr" class="">A signed statement from the owner of such building containing the following: </div><div data-canvas-width="31.562825000000004" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 224.966px; top: 1459.04px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.945703, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">2.1.</div><div data-canvas-width="558.7767500000001" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 262.461px; top: 1459.04px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.852959, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr" class="">A certification that the building no longer receives gas service; and</div></div><div class="annotationLayer"><a style="border-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; width: 97.288px; height: 18.499px; left: 226.112px; top: 402.975px; position: absolute; transform: matrix(1.66667, 0, 0, 1.66667, 0, 0); transform-origin: -226.112px -402.975px 0px;" href="https://www.nyc.gov/assets/buildings/local_laws/ll138of2021.pdf"></a></div></div><a name="32"></a><div id="pageContainer32" class="page" style="width: 1019px; height: 1319px;" data-loaded="true"><div style="width: 1019px; height: 1319px;" class="canvasWrapper"><canvas id="page32" width="1274" height="1649" style="width: 1019px; height: 1319px;"></canvas></div><div class="textLayer" style="width: 1274px; height: 1649px; transform: scale(0.8); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;"><div data-canvas-width="246.87657499999995" data-font-name="g_font_1244_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 16.75px; font-family: sans-serif; left: 150px; top: 75.5px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(1.03368, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">MAINTENANCE OF BUILDINGS</div><div data-canvas-width="31.562825000000004" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; font-family: serif; left: 225px; top: 148.75px; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(0.945703, 1); transform-origin: 0% 0% 0px;" dir="ltr">2.2.</div><div data-canvas-width="723.5504249999997" data-font-name="g_font_1246_0" data-angle="0" style="font-size: 20.75px; fo